      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POSH WHEELS (4) is generally an honest type in the frame at six of 12 starts but missed the placings last time when fourth (20.02) over 342m at this track. Happy to have her on top this line-up. RIBERY (1) was below best last time when fourth but prior to that was a Grade 6 winner in quick time at this track. Has the ability and can find best this time. MYSTIC GAZE (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 19.88 beating Long Gully Jack. Boasts two wins from four starts out of this box. One of the prime contenders. HERE COMES RHEA (5) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
